      {
        "id": 138241,
        "name": "XXVZ",
        "username": "XXVZ",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xxvz/{size}/2367_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-30T19:43:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"LukeWarmIce\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/71c47a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> LukeWarmIce:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I haven't looked at the sign up to be a tester page for a long time…saw the $40k and lol'd haha.I thought of signing up when they were accepting why back, $40 to help make something I like as good as it can be sounded great. &nbsp;But I backed away because I know testing can take enjoyment out of the game. &nbsp;I have nothing but respect for people that do it for any game.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, I haven't signed up mostly because I'd rather wait and get the finished product with all the art and such, playtesting seems almost like spoiling it. Although I have been tempted to get it.</p>",
